Omission
- [N1] Omitted trace (input 0): i1:the process begins by choosing a book. -> i2:either view the book details or see a list of new copies. Alternatively, they can also view a list of used copies. -> i3:see a list of new copies
- [N2] Omitted trace (input 1): i1:the process begins by choosing a book. -> i2:either view the book details or see a list of new copies. Alternatively, they can also view a list of used copies. -> i4:view a list of used copies -> i8:evaluate the list and then select their preferred copy to complete the process.
- [N3] Omitted trace (input 2): i1:the process begins by choosing a book. -> i2:either view the book details or see a list of new copies. Alternatively, they can also view a list of used copies. -> i5:If they choose to view the book details -> i6:they have the option to then view a list of new copies or proceed to select a copy -> i3:see a list of new copies
- [N4] Omitted trace (input 3): i1:the process begins by choosing a book. -> i2:either view the book details or see a list of new copies. Alternatively, they can also view a list of used copies. -> i5:If they choose to view the book details -> i6:they have the option to then view a list of new copies or proceed to select a copy -> i7:proceed to select a copy and end the process.

Addition
- [N5] Added trace (model 0): init(i1) -> action(n2,"choose a book") -> branch(b2,XOR) -> action(n4,"view: book details") -> branch(b1,XOR) -> converge(c1) -> action(n8,"view: new copies") -> end(e1)
- [N6] Added trace (model 1): init(i1) -> action(n2,"choose a book") -> branch(b2,XOR) -> action(n4,"view: book details") -> branch(b1,XOR) -> action(n6,"select a copy") -> end(e1)
- [N7] Added trace (model 2): init(i1) -> action(n2,"choose a book") -> branch(b2,XOR) -> converge(c1) -> action(n8,"view: new copies") -> end(e1)
- [N8] Added trace (model 3): init(i1) -> action(n2,"choose a book") -> branch(b2,XOR) -> action(n9,"view: used copies") -> action(n10,"evaluate and select a copy from the list") -> end(e2)
